      en: ["The original shrine was established on this site in 948 AD.", "The massive golden Gopuram (gateway tower) was completed in 2011.", "The annual temple festival lasts for 25 days, culminating in August.", "Male devotees must enter the inner sanctum with their chests uncovered.", "The temple was razed to the ground by Portuguese forces in 1624.", "The shrine is oriented towards the East and features four main entrances."],
      es: ["Construcción original: Siglo XV.", "Reconstrucción: Siglo XX (década de 1930).", "Altura del Gopuram: 30 metros.", "Número de santuarios en el complejo: 7.", "Visitantes en el festival Vel: más de 500.000.", "Superficie del terreno del templo: 2 hectáreas."],
      pt: ["Construção original: Século XV.", "Reconstrução: Século XX (década de 1930).", "Altura do Gopuram: 30 metros.", "Número de santuários no complexo: 7.", "Visitantes no festival Vel: mais de 500.000.", "Área do terreno do templo: 2 hectares."],
      fr: ["Construction originale : XVe siècle.", "Reconstruction : XXe siècle (années 1930).", "Hauteur du gopuram : 30 mètres.", "Nombre de sanctuaires dans le complexe : 7.", "Visiteurs lors du festival Vel : plus de 500 000.", "Surface du terrain du temple : 2 hectares."],
